{
  "version": "v3",
  "note": "Old and new OTel GenAI attribute names map to one internal field. The tellproof.* fields carry facts no GenAI convention defines yet (D-020); agents may override their names per deployment. Content fields are presence-only: their values are never read, and any attribute whose name starts with a presence_only_prefixes entry counts as content too. v3: the tellproof.* names (D-056); the plumbline.* names they replace are read as aliases. tellproof.canary.kind and tellproof.canary.caught mark a guardrail canary span (D-057).",
